18
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:00,450
The Treasury agent planned a euro payment.

19
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,350
The phone shows the exact terms.

20
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:17,250
Six seconds from Face ID to paid, in the Airwallex sandbox.

21
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,650
That is the transfer id.

22
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,750
Look it up yourself.

23
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,450
Now it's your turn.

24
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:29,666
Open your own test world, and sign an

25
00:01:29,716 --> 00:01:32,950
