An audit log, hash-chained:

33
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,550
check it yourself.

34
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,750
Two stopped at a limit.

35
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,150
Twenty-four of twenty-four decisions by Claude.

36
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:20,850
Real: the Airwallex sandbox, Metal testnet, Claude, and Face ID.

37
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,494
Ours, or simulated:

38
00:02:22,544 --> 00:02:25,505
the suppliers, the customer, the merchant, and

39
